✅ 4. setPriority() vs yield()

| Feature   | `setPriority()`             | `yield()`                          |
| --------- | --------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Purpose   | Suggest relative importance | Suggest giving up current CPU time |
| Affects   | Future scheduling           | Current execution                  |
| Guarantee | ❌ No                       | ❌ No                              |
| Static    | ❌ No                       | ✅ Yes                             |
